WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.830
Burn a strip of magnesium in
air, and weigh what's left.

2
00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:06.930
The white powder weighs
more than the metal did.

3
00:00:06.980 --> 00:00:10.030
Now let a carbonate
react in an open dish.

4
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.850
This time, what's left gets lighter.

5
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:16.290
But atoms can't be made,
and they can't be destroyed.

6
00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:19.890
So in the first reaction, where
did the extra mass come from?

7
00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:23.110
And in the second, where
did the missing mass go?

8
00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.830
In this mission, you'll see how
a reaction rearranges atoms,

9
00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.300
and how a balanced equation
keeps count of every one.

10
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.490
You'll track gases going into
and out of an open container.

11
00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:37.710
Your mission: find out where
the extra mass came from,

12
00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:39.850
and where the lost mass went.
